<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns BB to Mexico's 50 bln yen samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns BB to Mexico's 50 bln yen samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp said on Wednesday that it had assigned its BB rating to Mexico's 50 billion yen worth of four percent samurai bonds due March 11, 2004.</p>
<p>It said the outlook for the rating was stable.</p>
</text>
